
doctype html
html(lang="es")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        meta(name="viewport", content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
        title Iniciar sesión | Control Vehicular
        link(rel="stylesheet", href="/css/tailwind.css")

    body(class="min-h-screen bg-white text-slate-900")
        main(class="grid min-h-screen grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2")

            //- Panel izquierdo: formulario
            section(class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-12 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 xl:px-24")
                div(class="w-full max-w-md")

                    div(class="mb-10")
                        div(class="mb-8 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-violet-100 text-xl font-black text-violet-700")
                            | PR

                        p(class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-600")
                            | Control vehicular

                        h1(class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl")
                            | ¡Hola!
                            br
                            | Bienvenido de nuevo

                        p(class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-500")
                            | Ingresa tus credenciales para acceder al sistema de control de ingresos y salidas.

                    if error
                        div(class="mb-5 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-700")
                            p= error

                    form(method="POST", action="/login", class="space-y-5")

                        div
                            label(
                                for="username"
                                class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700"
                            ) Usuario

                            input(
                                type="text"
                                id="username"
                                name="username"
                                required
                                autocomplete="username"
                                placeholder="Ingresa tu usuario"
                                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-violet-500 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-violet-100"
                            )

                        div
                            label(
                                for="password"
                                class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700"
                            ) Contraseña

                            input(
                                type="password"
                                id="password"
                                name="password"
                                required
                                autocomplete="current-password"
                                placeholder="Ingresa tu contraseña"
                                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-violet-500 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-violet-100"
                            )

                        button(
                            type="submit"
                            class="w-full rounded-lg bg-violet-600 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-violet-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-violet-200"
                        ) Iniciar sesión

                    p(class="mt-10 text-center text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400")
                        | Sistema de Control Vehicular
                        br
                        | Acceso exclusivo para usuarios autorizados

            //- Panel derecho: ilustración
            section(class="relative hidden min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-violet-500 p-6 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:justify-center")
                div(class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-400 via-purple-500 to-violet-700")

                div(class="relative z-10 flex h-full w-full max-w-2xl flex-col items-center justify-center")
                    div(class="mb-6 text-center")
                        h2(class="text-3xl font-bold text-white")
                            | Tu seguridad, nuestra prioridad

                        p(class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-violet-100")
                            | Gestiona los accesos de forma organizada y segura.

                    img(
                        src="/images/login-security.png"
                        alt="Ilustración de seguridad y autenticación"
                        class="max-h-[65vh] w-full rounded-2xl object-contain shadow-2xl"
                    )

                    p(class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-violet-100")
                        | Control de ingresos y salidas
